  "title": "Company Information",
  "content_html": "<main class=\"p-page\">\n        <div class=\"l-container-fluid\">\n        <ul class=\"c-breadcrumb\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/BreadcrumbList\"><li class=\"c-breadcrumb__item\" itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\"><a itemprop=\"item\" href=\"https://rebooth.co.jp\"><span itemprop=\"name\" >HOME</span></a><meta itemprop=\"position\" content=\"1\" /></li><li class=\"c-breadcrumb__item\" itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\"><span itemprop=\"name\">Company Information</span><meta itemprop=\"position\" content=\"2\" /></li></ul>      </div>\n      <section class=\"p-page__header\">\n        <div class=\"l-container-fluid\">\n          <div class=\"p-page__title c-title-sec \">\n            <p class=\"c-text--en js-split\">\n              company            </p>\n            <h1 class=\"c-text--ja p-page__title--fade\">Company Information</h1>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n                                </section>  <div class=\"wp_block-content\">\n    <nav class=\"items-justified-left alignwide p-page-scroll-nav wp-block-navigation is-content-justification-left is-layout-flex wp-container-core-navigation-is-layout-92fbe0d5 wp-block-navigation-is-layout-flex\" aria-label=\"Navigation\"><ul class=\"wp-block-navigation__container items-justified-left alignwide p-page-scroll-nav wp-block-navigation\"><li class=\"wp-block-navigation-item wp-block-navigation-link\"><a class=\"wp-block-navigation-item__content\"  href=\"#message\"><span class=\"wp-block-navigation-item__label\">Message from the Representative</span></a></li><li class=\"wp-block-navigation-item wp-block-navigation-link\"><a class=\"wp-block-navigation-item__content\"  href=\"#outline\"><span class=\"wp-block-navigation-item__label\">Company Overview</span></a></li><li class=\"wp-block-navigation-item wp-block-navigation-link\"><a class=\"wp-block-navigation-item__content\"  href=\"#access\"><span class=\"wp-block-navigation-item__label\">Access</span></a></li><li class=\"wp-block-navigation-item wp-block-navigation-link\"><a class=\"wp-block-navigation-item__content\"  href=\"#history\"><span class=\"wp-block-navigation-item__label\">History</span></a></li></ul></nav>\n\n\n<div id=\"message\" class=\"wp-block-group p-page-column-box alignwide  is-style-sticky l-block is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group p-page-column-box__header is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\"><div class=\"lazyblock-section-title-ZGKeUE wp-block-lazyblock-section-title\"><hgroup class=\"c-title-sec is-dark\">\n\n  <p class=\"c-text--en js-split g-fall-text\">Message</p>\n\n  <h2 class=\"c-text--ja\">Message from the Representative</h2>\n\n</hgroup></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group p-page-column-box__body is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Exhibitions are valuable opportunities for companies to directly convey their ideas, technologies, and product value. However, booth construction requires considerable time and cost, and many materials are dismantled and discarded after the event. We aim to gradually reassess this norm.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br>Re:Booth (Re:ブース) is a reusable exhibition booth that retains high design quality while being engineered for repeated use in future exhibitions. By preserving visual appeal and corporate identity and designing with reuse in mind, we facilitate easier continuation of exhibition participation.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br>What we value is not merely building a booth.<br>We carefully listen to exhibition objectives, display content, and venue conditions, and collaboratively devise a form that the company can continue to use without difficulty.<br></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Environmental considerations and cost reductions vary in effectiveness depending on conditions. Therefore, we build realistic proposals that are easy to use on site and lead to the next exhibition, rather than speaking only of ideals.<br>Through Re:Booth, we support the coexistence of corporate exhibition participation and sustainable initiatives.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div id=\"outline\" class=\"wp-block-group p-page-column-box alignwide  is-style-sticky l-block is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group p-page-column-box__header is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\"><div class=\"lazyblock-section-title-1Cbm32 wp-block-lazyblock-section-title\"><hgroup class=\"c-title-sec is-dark\">\n\n  <p class=\"c-text--en js-split g-fall-text\">Outline </p>\n\n  <h2 class=\"c-text--ja\">Company Overview</h2>\n\n</hgroup></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group p-page-column-box__body is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table c-table-responsive-column\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Company Name</strong></td><td>Orgiast Co., Ltd. (English company name: Orgiast Co., Ltd.)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Location</strong></td><td><strong>Tokyo Head Office</strong><br>1F, 2-10-3 Yokoami, Sumida-ku, Tokyo 130-0015 <br>TEL：0120-487-121<br><br><strong>Osaka Head Office</strong><br>Toho Building 212, 2-15-24 Fukae Kita, Higashinari-ku, Osaka City, Osaka 537-0001<br>TEL：0120-487-121 FAX：06-6976-0212<br><br><strong>Saitama Shibui Warehouse</strong><br>〒350-0013 1351-3 Shibui, Kawagoe-shi, Saitama<br><br><strong>Saitama Second Warehouse</strong><br>〒331-0061 594 Nishizuma, Nishi-ku, Saitama-shi, Saitama<br><br><strong>Sapporo Sales Office</strong><br>〒064-0805 2-3-503, Minami 5-jo Nishi 15-chome, Chuo-ku, Sapporo, Hokkaido<br><br><strong>Nagoya Sales Office</strong><br>〒450-0002 2nd Floor, Ultimate Nagoya 1st, 3-4-10 Meieki, Nakamura-ku, Nagoya, Aichi<br><br><strong>Hiroshima Sales Office</strong><br>〒730-0051 Room A, 7th Floor, Aioibashi Building, 1-1-20 Otemachi, Naka-ku, Hiroshima, Hiroshima<br><br><strong>Fukuoka Sales Office</strong><br>〒810-0001 7th Floor, Tenjin First Building, 4-6-28 Tenjin, Chuo-ku, Fukuoka, Fukuoka<br><br><strong>Okinawa Sales Office</strong><br>〒900-0013 2-17-27-401 Makishi, Naha-shi, Okinawa</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Phone Number</strong></td><td>0120-487-121</td></tr><tr><td><strong>President &amp; CEO</strong></td><td>金功勇 (Representative Director &amp; President)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Established</strong></td><td>April 2006</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Capital</strong></td><td>5,000,000 yen</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Job Description</strong></td><td>Booth Production<br>Planning and production of in-house events<br>· Employee General Meeting (Kickoff Meeting)<br>· Company Briefing Session<br>· Award Ceremony<br>・Employee trips, etc.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div id=\"access\" class=\"wp-block-group p-page-column-box alignwide  is-style-sticky l-block is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group p-page-column-box__header is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\"><div class=\"lazyblock-section-title-tPCYo wp-block-lazyblock-section-title\"><hgroup class=\"c-title-sec is-dark\">\n\n  <p class=\"c-text--en js-split g-fall-text\">Access  </p>\n\n  <h2 class=\"c-text--ja\">Access</h2>\n\n</hgroup></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group p-page-column-box__body is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"c-frame-video\">\n<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d25922.45841637731!2d139.73817543890587!3d35.69405474906517!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x60188ced44d10dc9%3A0x8ef9cbd4e788893c!2z44ix44Kq44O844K444Oj44K544OI!5e0!3m2!1sja!2sjp!4v1788745248259!5m2!1sja!2sjp\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"></iframe>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-md-font-size wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--md);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--md)\">1F, 2-10-3 Yokou, Sumida-ku, Tokyo</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-light has-arrow-next is-size-sm is-style-light has-arrow-next is-size-sm\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/tu8P9yTzFaqu1asUA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">GoogleMap</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div id=\"history\" class=\"wp-block-group p-page-column-box alignwide  is-style-sticky l-block is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group p-page-column-box__header is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\"><div class=\"lazyblock-section-title-1rO9eB wp-block-lazyblock-section-title\"><hgroup class=\"c-title-sec is-dark\">\n\n  <p class=\"c-text--en js-split g-fall-text\">history  </p>\n\n  <h2 class=\"c-text--ja\">History</h2>\n\n</hgroup></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group p-page-column-box__body is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\"><div class=\"lazyblock-history-1ByjOK wp-block-lazyblock-history\">\n  <div class=\"c-timeline\">\n          <div class=\"c-timeline__item\">\n        <!-- 左側の年月エリア -->\n        <div class=\"c-timeline__date\">\n          <span class=\"c-timeline__year\">2006</span>Year<span class=\"c-timeline__month\">4</span>Month\n        </div>\n        <!-- 右側のテキストエリア -->\n        <div class=\"c-timeline__content\">\n          Orgiast Co., Ltd. established (company incorporation)        </div>\n      </div>\n          <div class=\"c-timeline__item\">\n        <!-- 左側の年月エリア -->\n        <div class=\"c-timeline__date\">\n          <span class=\"c-timeline__year\">2010</span>Year<span class=\"c-timeline__month\">4</span>Month\n        </div>\n        <!-- 右側のテキストエリア -->\n        <div class=\"c-timeline__content\">\n          Osaka branch opened        </div>\n      </div>\n          <div class=\"c-timeline__item\">\n        <!-- 左側の年月エリア -->\n        <div class=\"c-timeline__date\">\n          <span class=\"c-timeline__year\">2010</span>Year<span class=\"c-timeline__month\">5</span>Month\n        </div>\n        <!-- 右側のテキストエリア -->\n        <div class=\"c-timeline__content\">\n          Authorized shares changed to 800 shares        </div>\n      </div>\n          <div class=\"c-timeline__item\">\n        <!-- 左側の年月エリア -->\n        <div class=\"c-timeline__date\">\n          <span class=\"c-timeline__year\">2013</span>Year<span class=\"c-timeline__month\">12</span>Month\n        </div>\n        <!-- 右側のテキストエリア -->\n        <div class=\"c-timeline__content\">\n          Capital changed to 5,000,000 yen        </div>\n      </div>\n          <div class=\"c-timeline__item\">\n        <!-- 左側の年月エリア -->\n        <div class=\"c-timeline__date\">\n          <span class=\"c-timeline__year\">2014</span>Year<span class=\"c-timeline__month\">3</span>Month\n        </div>\n        <!-- 右側のテキストエリア -->\n        <div class=\"c-timeline__content\">\n          Launched specialized e-commerce site for in-house events 'In-House Event Department Store'        </div>\n      </div>\n          <div class=\"c-timeline__item\">\n        <!-- 左側の年月エリア -->\n        <div class=\"c-timeline__date\">\n          <span class=\"c-timeline__year\">2020</span>Year<span class=\"c-timeline__month\">11</span>Month\n        </div>\n        <!-- 右側のテキストエリア -->\n        <div class=\"c-timeline__content\">\n          Started specialized planning service for listing ceremonies        </div>\n      </div>\n          <div class=\"c-timeline__item\">\n        <!-- 左側の年月エリア -->\n        <div class=\"c-timeline__date\">\n          <span class=\"c-timeline__year\">2022</span>Year<span class=\"c-timeline__month\">6</span>Month\n        </div>\n        <!-- 右側のテキストエリア -->\n        <div class=\"c-timeline__content\">\n          Release of “Reusable SDGs-Type Exhibition Booth Re:Booth”        </div>\n      </div>\n          <div class=\"c-timeline__item\">\n        <!-- 左側の年月エリア -->\n        <div class=\"c-timeline__date\">\n          <span class=\"c-timeline__year\">2023</span>Year<span class=\"c-timeline__month\">12</span>Month\n        </div>\n        <!-- 右側のテキストエリア -->\n        <div class=\"c-timeline__content\">\n          Awarded the SDGs Business Hope Award at the 11th SDGs Business Seminar        </div>\n      </div>\n          <div class=\"c-timeline__item\">\n        <!-- 左側の年月エリア -->\n        <div class=\"c-timeline__date\">\n          <span class=\"c-timeline__year\">2024</span>Year<span class=\"c-timeline__month\">1</span>Month\n        </div>\n        <!-- 右側のテキストエリア -->\n        <div class=\"c-timeline__content\">\n          Trademark 'Re:Booth' registered (Trademark Registration No. 6772061)        </div>\n      </div>\n          <div class=\"c-timeline__item\">\n        <!-- 左側の年月エリア -->\n        <div class=\"c-timeline__date\">\n          <span class=\"c-timeline__year\">2024</span>Year<span class=\"c-timeline__month\">2</span>Month\n        </div>\n        <!-- 右側のテキストエリア -->\n        <div class=\"c-timeline__content\">\n          Re:Booth certified under &quot;Osaka City New Business Field Development Business Certification Program (Venture Procurement System)&quot;        </div>\n      </div>\n          <div class=\"c-timeline__item\">\n        <!-- 左側の年月エリア -->\n        <div class=\"c-timeline__date\">\n          <span class=\"c-timeline__year\">2024</span>Year<span class=\"c-timeline__month\">3</span>Month\n        </div>\n        <!-- 右側のテキストエリア -->\n        <div class=\"c-timeline__content\">\n          Fukuoka Sales Office established        </div>\n      </div>\n          <div class=\"c-timeline__item\">\n        <!-- 左側の年月エリア -->\n        <div class=\"c-timeline__date\">\n          <span class=\"c-timeline__year\">2024</span>Year<span class=\"c-timeline__month\">3</span>Month\n        </div>\n        <!-- 右側のテキストエリア -->\n        <div class=\"c-timeline__content\">\n          Saitama Shibui Warehouse established in Kawagoe City, Saitama Prefecture        </div>\n      </div>\n          <div class=\"c-timeline__item\">\n        <!-- 左側の年月エリア -->\n        <div class=\"c-timeline__date\">\n          <span class=\"c-timeline__year\">2024</span>Year<span class=\"c-timeline__month\">6</span>Month\n        </div>\n        <!-- 右側のテキストエリア -->\n        <div class=\"c-timeline__content\">\n          Saitama Second Warehouse established in Saitama City, Saitama Prefecture        </div>\n      </div>\n          <div class=\"c-timeline__item\">\n        <!-- 左側の年月エリア -->\n        <div class=\"c-timeline__date\">\n          <span class=\"c-timeline__year\">2024</span>Year<span class=\"c-timeline__month\">7</span>Month\n        </div>\n        <!-- 右側のテキストエリア -->\n        <div class=\"c-timeline__content\">\n          Sales offices established in Sapporo, Nagoya, Hiroshima, and Okinawa        </div>\n      </div>\n      </div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n  </div>\n  </div>\n</main>",
